/ The receipt's ground truth (docs/domain.md, "Receipt ground truth"): which sources exist, when each was
/ saved, what pre-filled a person's record, and for a tax-service record its items and header next to the
/ receipt's current values, the differences marked, with "Matches the print" / "Differs from the print"
/ (Receipts::GroundTruthChecksController). Outside the review form: the check is its own small form.
/   = render "receipts/ground_truth", receipt: @receipt, filter: @filter
ruby:
  records = receipt.ground_truths.to_a.index_by(&:source)
  manual = records["manual"]
  dps = records["dps_xml"]
section.review-section id="ground-truth" aria-labelledby="ground-truth-heading"
  h2.text-base#ground-truth-heading Ground truth
  dl.data-table
    .data-row
      dt.data-row-title By hand
      dd.data-row-value
        - if manual
          p.text-sm
            | Saved
            =< receipt_time(manual.updated_at)
            | . Pre-filled by
            =< ground_truth_prefill_label(manual)
            | .
          p.text-sm.text-ink-muted
            = "#{pluralize(manual.items.size, 'item')}; "
            - if manual.categories_known?
              = "categories known (#{ground_truth_categoriser_label(manual)} on the form)."
            - else
              | saved without categories.
        - else
          p.text-sm.text-ink-muted Not labelled yet. Correct the form, then "Save as ground truth".
    .data-row
      dt.data-row-title Tax-service record
      dd.data-row-value
        - if dps
          p.text-sm
            | Imported
            =< receipt_time(dps.updated_at)
            = ", #{dps.items_known? ? pluralize(dps.items.size, 'item') : 'no item lines'}."
          p.mt-1.flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-2.text-sm
            = ground_truth_badges([ dps ])
            - if dps.checked?
              span
                = dps.check_matches? ? "Matches the print" : "Differs from the print"
                | , checked
                =< receipt_time(dps.checked_at)
              - if dps.check_note
                span.text-ink-muted = "“#{dps.check_note}”"
            - else
              span.text-ink-muted Not checked against the print yet.
        - else
          p.text-sm.text-ink-muted None. Saved receipt files are imported with receipts:import_ground_truth_xml.

  - if dps
    = render "receipts/ground_truth_check", receipt:, record: dps, filter:
